ai-sandbox/personal-website/

# academic-hub holds copyrighted PDFs and their full-text conversions --
# these specific patterns are ignored to avoid uploading large files and
# IP-protected text (deny-list, not a blanket directory ignore: negating
# individual files back out of a fully-excluded directory tree is a known
# git gitignore pitfall -- a parent directory match blocks descent into it
# regardless of later "!" rules on files inside). Everything else under
# academic-hub -- scripts, the source-indexer's .index/, per-book
# _metadata.json, _image_descriptions.json, marker's run_config.json --
# is a derivative, not a reproduction of the full text, and stays tracked.
ai-sandbox/academic-hub/**/*.pdf
ai-sandbox/academic-hub/**/*.md
ai-sandbox/academic-hub/**/images/
ai-sandbox/academic-hub/**/*_pages_cache.json
# Raw notebook source (OneNote), not a derivative index/metadata file --
# treated the same as the source PDFs, not tracked.
ai-sandbox/academic-hub/**/*.one
ai-sandbox/academic-hub/**/*.onetoc2
